== Trivia ==
*'''Queen Nyx''' is a reference to the goddess [[w:Nyx|Nyx]] from Greek mythology. She is the personification of night.
*It is possible to give '''Queen Nyx''' a {{Item|Bachelor's Rose}} while in the {{Faction|Barbarian}} if the player has met the 12,000 {{Reputation|mage}} requirement. This can be done by etherwarping through the floor and quickly giving the Bachelor's Rose to '''Queen Nyx''' before the guards teleport the player out.

